WEBVTT

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.190
Izzy

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.190
Incoming Call

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.280
<i>Izzy.</i>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.530
<i>That voice...</i>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.330
<i>Been a while.</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.540
Is that... Blood?

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.790
I'm borrowing your little brat.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:24.960
I'll return him by morning.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.830
Blood? Wait...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.170
<i>Blood is... in Japan?</i>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.930
Reunion

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.900
Why'd you bring me here?

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:11.770
This is the Aryabhata 
Higher-Order Physics Lab,

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.740
the Kingdom's base for 
tattoo research in Japan.

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:20.070
They're studying the noise canceler 
system, per the princess's orders.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.820
Noise canceler?

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.910
It's a gods-be-damned system that uses the

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.080
human brain to render a tattoo ineffective.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:32.210
They've made guinea pigs of dozens 
of people here to study it.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:34.800
Unforgivable...

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.710
Well, time to go.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.010
Go?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.970
I'm BB, formerly of Brahman.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.350
Since my departure, 
I've opposed the Kingdom.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.850
I've wanted to ruin this 
place for a long time.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.900
Are you being serious?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.020
You be the judge of that.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.280
I'm going, too!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.540
You should probably think 
a bit more before you act.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:12.540
Your tattoo is the same as mine, isn't it?

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.540
And the Kingdom's princess, too...

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.960
Just how many of this tattoo are there?

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.260
Izzy didn't tell you?

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.180
Izzy? You know her?

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.140
Four.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.310
The same as the number of ruins.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.140
Ruins?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.310
Tattoo ruins exist in four places worldwide.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.350
America controls one,

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.400
and the Kingdom has control of two.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.690
That's why America is so desperate.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.610
Where's the fourth one?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:43.160
The objective of the Brahman members in Japan

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.530
is to uncover the fourth ruins.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.540
It's in Japan?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.050
That way.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:03.760
Good.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.600
I-It's so deep...

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.140
What's wrong, Il? Are you cold?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.440
Then I'll warm you up.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.690
Y-You mustn't, Princess... Not here...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.690
You'll anger the vice-captain...

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.110
Princess!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.070
Please be aware of where you are!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:29.700
Being a slave to lust all the time 
sets a bad example for your people!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.370
Cal, you're such a prude.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.670
Once you've done it the first time, 
it goes in so easy...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.800
Wh-Wh-What are you saying, Princess?!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:43.260
Th-Th-There's no man I have feelings for...

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.140
Oh, so there is? That's a surprise.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.640
Let's move on!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.350
Innocent as a newborn babe.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:56.600
Stop.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.070
Learn to sense your enemy's bloodlust.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.080
On the battlefield, if you 
can't do that, you're dead.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.290
Let's hurry.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.420
R-Right...

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.840
<i>Incredible... He didn't 
even use the void at all.</i>

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:31.720
What's this place?

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.430
Welcome!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.350
BB the traitor!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:42.360
Welcome to the garden of geniuses!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.650
Yeah, long time no see.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.900
What? You know him?

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.570
He's a mad scientist in a different sense.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.580
You can just call me Mr. Genius!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.120
What is intelligence?!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.790
Mr. Genius!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.750
What is research?!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.540
Mr. Genius!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.500
What is truth?!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.960
Mr. Genius!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.470
What is a genius?!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.680
Mr. Genius.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.260
That's right!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.560
I am a genius!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:17.640
That's rich, coming from a second-rate 
scientist who was relegated to Japan.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.400
I knew you would come here.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.610
You and your little friend, the third!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:23.980
What?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.190
All is as our divine queen wills it,

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.490
as she desires it.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.240
You will die like a 
wretched little mouse here

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:36.200
and fulfill your destiny as a key, BB!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:40.750
Now, behold the proof of my genius!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.960
Come forth, my genius forces!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:50.090
This is the culmination of all my research!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.850
Despite being a copy, it has

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.470
physical prowess equal to 
that of an original Sealed...

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:59.060
Perfect berserkers with no egos whatsoever!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:03.860
Of course, it's made up of guinea
pigs gathered right here in Japan.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.400
Karam...

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.360
What did you do to these guys?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.490
Forced assimilation of 
their sources, naturally.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.120
Even copy tattoos possess traces of source...

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.080
A mold, you might say.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.660
Source? What is "source"?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.750
Oh, my. It appears the 
third has not studied well.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.090
Manisha-kun, explain it to him.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:26.630
Yes, sir.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:31.380
The source is the nucleus of a tattoo, and is vital in manifesting its power.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.010
The nucleus?

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.430
In secular terms,

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.470
you might call it the "soul" or "spirit."

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.270
Have you never heard the 
word "source" before?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.360
I forgot to mention one thing.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.480
When these guys lose consciousness,

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.700
bombs inside their bodies explode!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.950
If you want to save them,

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.280
then just be still and let them kill you!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.660
Bastard!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.380
Here's a question for you, brat.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.210
What's the correct choice for a hero
of justice to make in this situation?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.840
That's...

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.180
I would save all of them.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.890
Get them!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.440
Punish the traitors to our queen with death!

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.370
<i>If we're supposed to go easy so 
they don't lose consciousness...</i>

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.750
We won't get anywhere unless we 
do something about the bombs!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.920
Director Karam, if we should lose,

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.510
the boy is one thing, but...

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.640
A few little bombs won't kill BB, you say?

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.890
No need to worry, Manisha-kun.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:06.980
BB is no longer able to use 
his power on a large scale.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:11.230
To be precise, the moment 
he does, he'll be devoured.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:16.240
You were already near your limit
the instant you left the Kingdom.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:19.780
I see...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.160
So you met him?

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.080
He may be fully aware of it,

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.420
but he is acting in accordance with my plans.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.880
It is my duty to kill that man,

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.680
as the vice-captain of Brahman.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.600
The judgment awaiting traitors is death.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.730
Could she be any more dependable?

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.560
Is that even possible?!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.370
Brat...

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.910
I'll teach you what it means 
to be a hero of justice.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.680
<i>That's... the source?</i>

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:30.560
That's the power that 
knocked me unconscious...

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.520
But that means...

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.400
You created fluctuations 
in space using the void?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.610
You never fail to impress, BB!

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.160
However!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.790
Why? Why?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.670
Why aren't they exploding?!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.380
What the hell is...

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.880
Don't worry.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.510
I got rid of the bombs.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.140
Impossible! This cannot be!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:08.270
He located each of the bombs 
in the middle of battle

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:12.230
and used Void Maker to erase them 
without harming their organs?!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.820
And why isn't the noise canceler working?!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.320
This is why you're just second-rate.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.540
You may have wiped out their egos,

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:31.370
but that's exactly why your 
noise canceler didn't work.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.050
I won't let you kill Karam!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.760
BB, don't!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.390
W-Wait!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.390
I don't care what happens to me,

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.430
but don't hurt her!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.890
Please, don't hurt Manisha!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.730
Listen good, brat.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:00.690
Punishing these two would be our own justice.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:05.570
These two lowlifes trying to save 
each other is their own justice.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.620
If one person insists on 
carrying out their own justice,

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.210
someone else is going to get 
the short end of the stick.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.420
However, heroes are, invariably, egoists.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:19.300
There are countless fictional heroes 
who charge in without thinking

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:23.220
and save everyone with nothing but 
some half-assed amazing power.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.180
But imagine if those self-absorbed
morons actually existed in reality.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.310
They'd be the ultimate nuisance.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.810
What a true hero of justice needs

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.770
is the almighty power to make 
his own ideals into reality

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.280
and the resolve to force 
his own justice on others.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.260
You didn't kill them, right?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.550
What reason is there to kill them?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.010
Killing goes against my idea of justice.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.220
<i>He's the real deal.</i>

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:14.020
<i>He's not a fake, or imaginary.</i>

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:18.190
<i>He's an actual hero of justice.</i>

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:30.120
Well, I suppose it's time to begin.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.830
I'll need you to stand guard for a while.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.460
You can count on me, Princess.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.720
Akatsuka Seigi, Blood Blackstone...

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.890
I'm sure the underside

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:55.180
of this world will gently embrace you.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.130
The triggerless tattoo's restorative power

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.170
never ceases to amaze me.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.090
It's fundamentally different from the 
way living things heal their wounds.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:30.930
You basically have an immortal body,

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.810
but can't live long...

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.470
It's hardly a joke you can laugh at.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.730
I won't die.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.560
That's what the kid is for.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.230
Here's the data I got from the lab.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:47.110
I actually felt grateful to you this time.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.700
What an honor.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.410
But that doesn't mean

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.200
you no longer bear the 
responsibility for it, Wiseman.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.870
I know that.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:00.250
Now that I know what her goal is,

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:03.460
I can't afford to not help you.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.960
And you will make my wish come true.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.680
We have two options...

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.390
To spend eternity in servitude,

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.390
or to fight back now.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.190
That one was pretty good, right?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.570
You learn quickly.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.370
To fill in the space that the 
rock creates in the water,

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.870
the surrounding water presses in,

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.120
collides, and spreads 
outward, forming ripples.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.830
The logic is the same.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:46.250
I didn't realize Void Maker 
could be used this way.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.260
Make the particles even smaller.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.260
Just by grazing their nerves,

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.970
you can put an enemy in 
a wheelchair for life.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.430
You're fully aware that this 
ability is dangerous, right?

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.940
How small should I make them?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.860
At the least...

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.610
about this size.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.240
Wow...

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.740
Can I even do that?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.820
I'll teach you how.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:16.740
Really?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.580
But why do all this for me?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.870
Good question. You'll find out soon enough.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.790
Aww, what the heck?

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.710
You want to get stronger, don't you?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.510
Blood.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.640
The oscillator?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.020
He's got a long way to go, too.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.150
Seigi trusts me.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.320
I really didn't want to do this...

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.900
You knew, right?

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:55.070
There's no way you wouldn't 
notice the oscillator.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.700
Blood Blackstone, former US Army major.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.500
Tell me. Why did you go to the Kingdom?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.580
Tell me everything!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.580
You never change.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:09.340
You're just like back then.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.500
Don't dodge the subject!

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.630
I'm only doing what I want.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.470
I won't make the brat do anything bad.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.890
Don't worry.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.890
That's not...

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.520
That's not what I'm asking!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.860
After you left...

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.200
Do you know how much I...

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.710
I see you still have my coat.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.340
Don't treat me like a child.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:57.300
To be honest, I had no intention of 
seeing you before all this was over.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.140
Listen to me, Izzy.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.520
The situation is grave.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.310
It's not even in the same dimension as

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.270
developing tattoos into weapons anymore.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:09.980
What do you mean?

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:13.320
The ruins aren't just 
places to store tattoos.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.150
The ruins are the main engines for

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.570
rewriting the world using 
the power of tattoos.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.780
Rewriting the world?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.490
For that, you need all four of the ruins.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.500
The princess has already 
claimed two for the Kingdom,

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.580
and has probably made contact with the third.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.920
The disease that results in death is despair.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.720
Kierkegaard...

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.010
What are you plotting, BB?

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:43.720
Does one who shouldn't even be 
alive still have some kind of hope?

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:48.440
Absorbed? You can't mean...

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:54.360
Yes. Her true goal is the alteration 
of the world through the ruins.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:59.650
It's probably too late to get 
to the fourth ruins in Japan.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:02.410
Protect the third ruins in the Grand Canyon.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:05.490
I'll stop Arya.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.290
You never change...

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.370
You're still antisocial, selfish,

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:13.000
always making decisions on your own

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.050
and taking everything upon yourself.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.010
Does my opinion mean nothing?

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.590
Contradicting yourself?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:21.220
Pathetic.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.640
Blood!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.810
Power changes people.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.430
Keep an eye on that brat to make sure 
he doesn't stray down the wrong path.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:29.680
Wait, Blood!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:36.150
<i>You haven't changed...</i>

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:38.860
<i>In that case,</i>

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.490
<i>I can believe in you.</i>

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.290
The nanomachine inside that capsule,

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.170
along with this device,

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:58.050
will interfere with your cerebrum 
from the inside and out

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.510
to access the source code for your tattoo.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.470
The code can't be rewritten,

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.470
but we should be able to add to it.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.140
Will it actually work?

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:10.180
That depends on you.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.230
Leave it to me.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.440
Hi, Grandpa!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.940
Where's Seigi?

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:22.780
Oh, Touko-chan. 
Seigi's passed out in the dojo.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.910
Thanks!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.160
Seigi! I brought a watermelon!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.830
Let's eat it... together...

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.880
To ignore a man offering himself...

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.340
is a woman's shame!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.930
Huh? Touko?

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.770
G-Guten Morgen...

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.900
What the?

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.700
You've had Izzy-san, your grandpa,

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.990
and now that guy named BB 
training you lately, right?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.120
You're going to wear yourself out.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.960
BB is so amazing.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.920
No matter what's going on, 
he stays true to his own logic.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.300
I want to become like him as soon as I can.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.470
This was the right thing to do, wasn't it?

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:28.010
What was?

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.010
This thing on me.

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:34.270
It lets me exist in your 
world and see what you see.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.770
Of course, I don't like when 
things are dangerous or scary,

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.230
but as long as I'm with you, I don't mind.

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:42.610
Touko...

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:46.070
Will you stay with me from now on?

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.030
Actually, is it

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:50.530
okay if I stay with you?

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.200
Yeah...

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:56.000
I guess it's okay if we can be together.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:33.680
I'm gonna kick the Kingdom's ass.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:39.680
I just found Brahman.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:42.770
Pleasure to meet you.

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:46.690
I am Cal Shekhar, vice-captain of Brahman.

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:49.740
It's no use pleading for your life now.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:54.120
I need you to fulfill your destiny as a key.

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.950
Storm
